Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 请您把您的设备暂时关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna have to ask you to switch that off for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,行 谢啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这像什么吗  这有点像过山车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it's kinda like? It's kinda like a rollercoaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,懂我什么意思吗  像过山车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean? It's like a roller coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,试试看 学我的动作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try it, try it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 这个伦敦眼有多高啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How tall... How tall is the Eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 这个大本钟有多高啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How tall... How tall is Big Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,从此之后 我就在科技记者的岗位上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since then, I've been working as a technology correspondent
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.17,0:04:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,工作了两年  挺不错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for about two years now. It's been great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害啊 太牛逼了  也就是说 你做电视报道啊 什么的 之类的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool, that's awesome. So you do, like, TV reports and, like, you're like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 只做网站的 - 哦 只有网站的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, just the website. - Oh, just the website?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 会有一些视频报道 但是主要是科技产业的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, there's some video stuff, but tech industry pieces mainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 科技啊  真厉害  科技这玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool, tech. Tech's awesome. Tech's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.38,0:04:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那你都去过哪儿了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where have you been so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是像印第安纳·琼斯那样探索地图吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travelling around the map like Indiana Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 走遍地图上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Where the adventure line
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,每一条冒险旅程啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}goes zigzagging all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 实际上 这趟旅程已经临近结尾了  呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, actually, I'm almost done. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:05:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我一开始先飞到悉尼 然后去了泰国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I started off, flew into Sydney, went to Thailand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真羡慕你 - 印度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, jealous. - India. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还去了罗马 探索了罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Rome, went to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 整个欧洲玩了个遍 - 我都还没全去过来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did the whole Europe vacation. - Even I haven't done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, really? - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,棒极了  我去了西班牙的潘普洛纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was awesome. I went to Pamplona in Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那儿是不是有奔牛节的 - 我也去玩了一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that where they do the bull runs? - Ran with the bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去跟着牛跑了吗 - 是的 我也去跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ran with the bulls? - I ran with the bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以给我留了个这玩意儿 - 我的天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's how I got this. - Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是印第安纳·琼斯啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really are Indiana Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你包里是不是装了鞭子和帽子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you got your whip in your bag and your hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我从纳粹手里拯救了世界  挺爽的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved the world from the Nazis. That was pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是 我只是想做些以前没做过的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, you know, just... trying to do, you know, shit I've never done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你这趟旅行的初衷吗  你想要 嗯 找寻自我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you're doing on this trip? You're, like, finding yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.59,0:05:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 差不多吧  我是说 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, um... in a way. I mean, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我其实就是想离家里人远一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really to get away from the family home is what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这其实 这他妈挺无聊的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that was... Whatever, that's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 可惜对于你这种冒险者来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I'm afraid Britain's pretty tame
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,英国大概算是挺没劲的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as far as daredevil opportunities go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  没事 反正这也是我旅途的最后一站了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? It's alright, it's the last leg of the trip anyway so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很不幸我下周就得回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... unfortunately home next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没什么时间 - 下周啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not much time... - Next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 那很快就到了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - That's not very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 很短 - 嗯哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it's not. - Mnh-mnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你能告诉我这儿有什么好玩的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... I could use some suggestions on fun shit to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯  好玩的啊 - 好玩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hmm. Fun shit to do? - Fun shit to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗷  嗷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  另一条战斗伤疤啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Another battle scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 你是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess, you were, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在开普敦抓鲨鱼啊 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}totally shark fishing in Cape Town, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你学的最像的美国口音吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that your best American accent?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 挺不错的啊  这个不是 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - That's pretty good. No, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:07:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是一个高中时候的混混 乔什·皮特斯给我的小礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was courtesy of Josh Peters, high school dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩在手工课的时候打起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He and I got into a fight in shop class.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他用一个 嗯 金属棍子打了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he hit me with this, like, metal rod thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个混球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an arsehole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个“混球”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an arsehole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这口音学的太烂了 - 抱歉哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's terrible. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你的还是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that you or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 肯定是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's gotta be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"老妈"  真是纯美式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mom." You're so American.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你不打算接吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you not gonna get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这也太冷漠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that was a little impersonal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你想和她聊聊吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you wanna talk to her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想和我妈聊聊吗  我可以打回去啊 - 可以啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanna talk to my mum? I'll call back. - Fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还是算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你饿了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 这么多游戏  你就像个游戏工作者啊  好酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, look at all these games. You're, like, a gamer. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,当然啦  我是以此为生的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I am. For my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:08:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 你玩街霸没被女生打哭过啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, a girl never beat you at Street Fighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 这是你的约会指南吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this... Like, this is, like, your dating manual?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  《奇点》吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? The Singularity?
