Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.09,0:23:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢让玩家吓一跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have always liked to make the player jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.39,0:23:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧  你害怕了 你吓一跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frightened. You get scared, you jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.27,0:23:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 之后 你感觉很爽 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Afterwards, you feel good. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.46,0:23:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你会感受到喜悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.44,0:23:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.71,0:23:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.29,0:23:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,因为肾上腺素急升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of the adrenaline rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.91,0:23:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但是最主要是因为你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But mostly because you are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你在一个安全的环境里面对了你最深的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have faced your greatest fears in a safe environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.19,0:23:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,它能释放你的恐惧  能让你自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a release of fear. It liberates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.41,0:23:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对  没错 我太同意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I mean, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.60,0:23:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在正在开发一款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we are working on now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.14,0:23:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,史上最个性定制化的生存恐怖游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the most personal survival horror game in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.68,0:23:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.39,0:23:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这款游戏能通过你自己的思想 找出你最害怕的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One that works out how to scare you by using your own mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:23:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦  这 这听起来真的是太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. That... That sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经迫不及待了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.70,0:24:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在上传一个神经网络包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm uploading a neural net package.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.27,0:24:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,神经网络包 神经网 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neural net packing, neural net. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这名字可能会有点儿效果  都是90年代的词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name could use a little work, I think. It's all 90s.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.91,0:24:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的 这是个好名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just kidding, it's a good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是目前最尖端的人工智能技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's state of the art intelligence software.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它能在运行中边学习边自我改写  它可以监测脑部活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It learns and adapts on the fly. It'll monitor your brain activity
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,从而计算出怎样才能最大程度地惊吓你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and try and work out how best to frighten you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.61,0:24:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,然后根据你的经历而做出调整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then adjust to your experience accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.78,0:24:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.08,0:24:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你准备好了吗 - 准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you ready? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.44,0:24:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把我传送上去 我们开始吧 准备射击 - 闭上眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Beam me up. Here we go, lock and load. - Eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.79,0:24:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在的时间是下午6时17分 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Time is currently 6:17 p.m. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.86,0:24:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,正在上传中  五 四 三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's uploading. Five, four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.95,0:24:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在有什么感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.86,0:25:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.44,0:25:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉不错  挺正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel good. I feel normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.81,0:25:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 慢慢站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Stand up, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备好开始游戏了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.52,0:25:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是哈莱克之影里面的房子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this the Harlech Shadow house?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.68,0:25:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是那房子的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's part of the estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.01,0:25:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这其实是猎场管理员的小屋  但是 对 就是按照游戏里建造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gamekeeper's lodge, actually. But, yeah, this was the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.86,0:25:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的布局和游戏中的一样 包括质地纹理也都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The layout was replicated for the game and the texture scanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.98,0:25:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是 太酷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very, very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏内容是什么 我该做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's the game, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.13,0:26:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要做任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.75,0:26:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要一个人呆在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just stay in here alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.54,0:26:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看你可以坚持多久 直到你害怕得无法继续为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}see how long you last until you're too scared to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.36,0:26:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我只要呆在这里就行了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So all I have to do is, like, stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.03,0:26:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还能拿到钱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I get paid for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.05,0:26:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回控制室了 我会在那儿监控这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back in the control room, watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.87,0:26:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这里到处都是摄像头 所以不要偷那些银质餐具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are cameras all over, so no stealing the silverware.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.46,0:26:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,戴上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now there's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.25,0:26:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 是耳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And what's this? - It's an earpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.25,0:26:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对 戴上这个 我们就可以保持联络了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, just pop it in, and you and I will be in contact the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.20,0:26:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.49,0:26:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我对你说话 你就能听到吗  太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can, like, talk to you, and you'll hear it? Great, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.60,0:26:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 你看到的所有东西 都不可能对你造成身体上的伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, nothing you'll see can physically harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.04,0:26:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是视觉和听觉效果 就像之前的打地鼠游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all just audio-visual, like the gopher game.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.40,0:26:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.35,0:26:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 如果情况太激烈的话 我们会随时叫停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it does get too intense, we can pull you out at any time
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.68,0:26:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 结束实验 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and stop the experiment. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.86,0:26:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你能想一个安全词吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a safe word you can think of?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.70,0:26:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就算在危难关头 也能简单想起的单词 有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something easy to remember in distress?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.69,0:26:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,“停”这个词怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about the word "stop"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.28,0:27:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不错  就喊“停”吧 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good choice. "Stop" it is. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.61,0:27:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那你就自己好好享受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we'll leave you to enjoy your evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.66,0:27:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 你会在几分钟后听到我的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alright. - You'll hear from me in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.39,0:27:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不用客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.64,0:27:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的  放松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, all right. Well, take her easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.89,0:27:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哈莱克之影啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harlech... Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.39,0:27:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是真的吗  对 这是真的 是真的 是真的死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this real? Yeah, it's real. That's real. It's really dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.11,0:28:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 库珀 - 噢 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cooper. - Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你听到我说话了吗 - 一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you hearing me? - Loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.41,0:28:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来你已经打算开始喝酒啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reaching for the Dutch courage already, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.82,0:28:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 这红酒里不含酒精 - 没意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm afraid that wine's non-alcoholic. - Lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.71,0:28:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们需要你保持清醒的头脑 - 好吧  有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, we need you with a clear head. - Okay. Fair point. Fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.05,0:28:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这件工艺品质量很好  真是太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is high-quality craftsmanship. This is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.62,0:28:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,雕刻得很细腻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's good woodwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这幅画中就是这栋屋子 - 观察力不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's this place. - Full marks for observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm-hmm! Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.47,0:29:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 挺爽的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, there we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.49,0:29:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.91,0:29:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit. - What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.00,0:29:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我老是忘记我没带手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just forgot I don't have my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.54,0:29:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直习惯性地伸手拿手机 完全忘记我根本就没带手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep going for it, I forget it's not in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.56,0:29:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,而这里也没有电视 所以说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's, uh... no TV here, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.74,0:29:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到十九世纪  没有电视 没有互联网 没有Wi-Fi\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the 19th century. No TV, no Internet, no wi-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:30:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 难怪人们老是看见鬼鬼怪怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. No wonder people were seeing shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.26,0:30:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能是无聊得发疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably were just bored out of their gourds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.56,0:30:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,对 那也是对人们见到鬼怪的主导解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's the leading theory about ghost sightings.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.65,0:30:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,当缺乏刺激时 人的意识会作祟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mind plays tricks when less stimulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.28,0:30:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那时人们的消遣方式很少 所以他们常常能看到鬼怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fewer distractions, people saw more ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.56,0:30:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that a nice piece of info?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.21,0:30:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,至少他们还有书看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they got literature, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.44,0:30:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,太贴心了 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pretty sweet, right?
